<metadata preset-name="Garage Fuzz Combo" preset-author="Headroom" preset-comment="A germanium fuzz into a small class-A 1x12 combo that's already cranked: trashy, loud and fun, with fuzz and amp grind piling up into a ragged roar. Riffs and two-piece-band chords; back the guitar volume off and the fuzz turns into a gritty crunch." based-on="" based-on-path=""/>
