<headroom-library version="1" id="crunch-garage-fuzz-combo" category="Crunch" order="170" instrument="guitar" style="Garage">
  <description>A germanium fuzz into a small class-A 1x12 combo that's already cranked: trashy, loud and fun, with fuzz and amp grind piling up into a ragged roar. Riffs and two-piece-band chords; back the guitar volume off and the fuzz turns into a gritty crunch.</description>
  <tags><tag>Crunch</tag><tag>Garage</tag><tag>Fuzz</tag><tag>Rhythm</tag><tag>Riff</tag><tag>Lo-fi</tag></tags>
  <sources>
    <source url="https://www.guitarworld.com/gw-archive/interview-guitarist-dan-auerbach-discusses-gear-influences-and-latest-black-keys-album-el-camino" title="Guitar World: Dan Auerbach discusses gear, influences and El Camino"/>
    <source url="https://www.vintageguitar.com/12131/dan-auerbach/" title="Vintage Guitar: Dan Auerbach"/>
    <source url="https://www.guitarworld.com/features/jimmy-page-communication-breakdown-tone" title="Guitar World: the secrets behind Jimmy Page's tone on 'Communication Breakdown'"/>
    <source url="https://tapeop.com/interviews/127/dan-auerbach" title="Tape Op #127: Dan Auerbach"/>
  </sources>
</headroom-library>
</headroom-preset>
